    disables object CameraBoundingBox\n          enables object SpencerEncounterCameraBounds\n         
    enables component EncounterCamera (UnityEngine.Camera)\n          disables component
    Main Camera (UnityEngine.Camera)\n          enables object EncounterComponents\n         
    disables object LevelAudioSource\n          disables object ThomasHappy\n         
    enables object ThomasScared\n          disables object Thomas'sFaces\n         
    enables object Thomas'sFacesScared\n          plays sound Spencer's Whistle at
    volume 1 and at pitch 1\n"
  description: 
  enableTrigger: 1
  allowRetrigger: 0
  hasPreconditions: 0
